-    <h1>L2G Builder/Merger <span class="small">L2G-BM v3.10</span></h1>
-    <p>A local/offline bridge for the full workbook loop: <strong>Workshop Handoff → generated or existing workbook → Workbook Merge return</strong>. v3.10 adds the bounded RG-4 SSP Final Word-QA Sidecar producer while preserving the v3.8 exception-resolution ledger, compatibility governance, decision-plan workflow, and three-stage workbook diff. Build mode uses the embedded L2G Builder Template v2 when no template is uploaded; Merge mode returns reviewed workbook results through <code>l2g_workbook_merge_v1.json</code>; External CSV mode remains a literal CSV-to-XLSX path.</p>
+    <h1>L2G Builder/Merger <span class="small">L2G-BM v3.10.1</span></h1>
+    <p>A local/offline bridge for the full workbook loop: <strong>Workshop Handoff → generated or existing workbook → Workbook Merge return</strong>. v3.10.1 adds strict Workbook Handoff validation and lossless Workshop action/evidence-ownership preservation while retaining the bounded RG-4 SSP Final Word-QA Sidecar producer while preserving the v3.8 exception-resolution ledger, compatibility governance, decision-plan workflow, and three-stage workbook diff. Build mode uses the embedded L2G Builder Template v2 when no template is uploaded; Merge mode returns reviewed workbook results through <code>l2g_workbook_merge_v1.json</code>; External CSV mode remains a literal CSV-to-XLSX path.</p>
     <div class="callout"><strong>Safety guardrail:</strong> Build mode adds workshop context only and does not auto-mark practices/objectives as Met, Not Met, Fully Implemented, Evidence Sufficient, Objective Validated, Workbook Validated, Assessment Ready, Final CMMC Status, or Final Score. Merge mode exports workbook-derived status because the source is the reviewed Gap Analysis Workbook.</div>
